{"id":"b88be0fc886200c3","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-assignment.md","title":"赋值与变量更新","display":"df-assignment — 赋值与变量更新","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-assignment","aliases":["43-df-assignment"],"display":"df-assignment — 赋值与变量更新","depends_on":["[[43-df-structure]]","[[43-df-variable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-assignment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-assignment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-assignment — 赋值与变量更新"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5c55ddf2aa11f80\" href=\"?note=f5c55ddf2aa11f80\" title=\"43-df-structure\">43-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d30a215bc9db4b5d\" href=\"?note=d30a215bc9db4b5d\" title=\"43-df-variable\">43-df-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,I)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,I)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in A^{\\operatorname{Var}}\">\\(\\beta\\in A^{\\operatorname{Var}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Assign}_{\\mathfrak A}:=A^{\\operatorname{Var}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Assign}_{\\mathfrak A}:=A^{\\operatorname{Var}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta[x\\mapsto a]:=(\\beta\\upharpoonright(\\operatorname{Var}\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{(x,a)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]:=(\\beta\\upharpoonright(\\operatorname{Var}\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{(x,a)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta[x\\mapsto a](y)=\\begin{cases}a,&amp;y=x,\\\\\\beta(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta[x\\mapsto a](y)=\\begin{cases}a,&amp;y=x,\\\\\\beta(y),&amp;y\\ne x.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补全原文更新式中β缺少前两节类型声明的问题；函数图构造显式保证赋值更新唯一。</p>\n<p>来源：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。 此项为支撑原有形式化的一阶逻辑基础，非声称原书有独立同名定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5c55ddf2aa11f80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"d30a215bc9db4b5d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-variable]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=(A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in A^{\\operatorname{Var}}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\operatorname{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Assign}_{\\mathfrak A}:=A^{\\operatorname{Var}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta[x\\mapsto a]:=(\\beta\\upharpoonright(\\operatorname{Var}\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{(x,a)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta[x\\mapsto a](y)=\\begin{cases}a,&y=x,\\\\\\beta(y),&y\\ne x.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1376,"backlinks":[{"id":"3238d7fca6c27a3f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-487","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-assignment]] — 赋值与变量更新"}],"outgoing":["f5c55ddf2aa11f80","d30a215bc9db4b5d"]}